WEBVTT

00:07.700 --> 00:08.967
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.033 --> 00:10.633
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.700 --> 00:12.133
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.200 --> 00:14.067
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.133 --> 00:16.867
- * Ohh... *
-*哦...*

00:16.933 --> 00:19.200
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.267 --> 00:21.200
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.267 --> 00:23.133
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.200 --> 00:24.867
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.933 --> 00:27.133
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.200 --> 00:29.000
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.067 --> 00:31.200
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.267 --> 00:33.200
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.267 --> 00:35.067
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.133 --> 00:37.233
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.300 --> 00:39.367
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.433 --> 00:40.700
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.767 --> 00:42.567
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.633 --> 00:45.300
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.367 --> 00:47.567
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:47.633 --> 00:49.267
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.767 --> 00:54.700
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

00:54.767 --> 01:00.700
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:00.767 --> 01:02.700
- Stroke!
- 中风！

01:02.767 --> 01:04.767
Stroke!
中风！

01:04.833 --> 01:06.233
Stroke!
中风！

01:06.300 --> 01:09.067
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

01:09.100 --> 01:10.167
Hey, kiddies!
嘿，孩子们！

01:10.233 --> 01:11.633
It's your old pal, Patchy,
这是你的老朋友帕奇

01:11.700 --> 01:13.433
floating somewhere
over Bikini Bottom.
漂浮在某处
比基尼底部。

01:13.500 --> 01:15.433
I sailed down here
to witness something
我航行到这里
见证某事

01:15.500 --> 01:17.700
that only happens
every 100 years.
那只会发生
每100年一次。

01:17.767 --> 01:20.433
Why, me and my trusted parrot,
Potty, wouldn't miss it
为什么，我和我信任的鹦鹉，
盆栽，不会错过

01:20.500 --> 01:22.967
for the world,
would we, Potty?
对于世界来说，
我们会吗，波蒂？

01:23.067 --> 01:24.633
Potty?
便壶？

01:24.700 --> 01:25.767
Rah!
啊！

01:25.833 --> 01:27.500
I'm just here for the buffet.
我只是来吃自助餐的。

01:27.567 --> 01:28.767
[gulping]
[吞咽]

01:28.833 --> 01:30.167
Oh, Potty!
哦，波蒂！

01:30.233 --> 01:32.067
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

01:32.100 --> 01:34.067
Give me that!
给我那个！

01:34.100 --> 01:37.067
[straining]
[紧张]

01:37.100 --> 01:39.433
Potty, I told you
to leave those fish alone!
便盆，我告诉过你了
别管那些鱼了！

01:39.500 --> 01:42.500
What do you think you are,
a seahawk?
你以为你是什么，
海鹰？

01:42.567 --> 01:44.067
[laughing]
[笑]

01:44.100 --> 01:46.167
I can't help it
if I was born a predator.
我无能为力
如果我生来就是一个掠夺者。

01:46.233 --> 01:47.700
Rah!
- Oh, Potty.
啊！
- 哦，便盆。

01:47.767 --> 01:48.967
I guess you're right.
我想你是对的。

01:49.067 --> 01:50.700
Can you ever forgive me?
你能原谅我吗？

01:50.767 --> 01:52.433
Shake.
[crunching]
摇。
[嘎吱嘎吱]

01:52.500 --> 01:53.433
Oh! Oh! Oh!
哦！哦！哦！

01:53.500 --> 01:55.500
[groaning]
- Now I can.
[呻吟]
- 现在我可以了。

01:55.567 --> 01:56.900
Rah!
啊！

01:56.967 --> 01:58.900
Oh, get out of here!
噢，离开这里！

01:58.967 --> 02:01.067
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

02:01.100 --> 02:02.900
Yep!
是的！

02:02.967 --> 02:04.767
Whoosh!
[water sloshing]
嗖嗖！
[水晃动]

02:04.833 --> 02:07.767
[laughing]
[笑]

02:07.833 --> 02:09.233
Oh, oh, yeah!
哦，哦，是啊！

02:09.300 --> 02:10.833
I'm gonna save
these mental pictures
我要拯救
这些心理画面

02:10.900 --> 02:12.700
for me grandkids.
对于我的孙子们来说。

02:12.767 --> 02:14.067
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

02:14.100 --> 02:16.833
Oh, that's better.
哦，这样好多了。

02:16.900 --> 02:19.600
all: * Squirrelly birthday,
dear Sandy *
所有：*松鼠生日，
亲爱的桑迪*

02:19.667 --> 02:23.133
* Squirrelly birthday to you *
*祝你生日快乐*

02:23.200 --> 02:25.133
[all cheering]
Hooray!
[大家欢呼]
万岁！

02:25.200 --> 02:27.367
- Y'all are the best
aquatic critter friends
- 你们都是最棒的
水生动物朋友

02:27.433 --> 02:30.233
a lone star from out of town
could ever have.
来自城外的一颗孤独的星星
可能曾经有过。

02:30.300 --> 02:31.700
- Cake time!
- 蛋糕时间！

02:31.767 --> 02:33.067
Wah!
哇！

02:33.100 --> 02:36.067
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

02:36.100 --> 02:40.900
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:40.967 --> 02:42.233
- Don't worry.
- 不用担心。

02:42.300 --> 02:44.067
I always carry a spare.
我总是带着备用的。

02:44.100 --> 02:45.500
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:45.567 --> 02:46.833
- [gasping]
- [喘气]

02:46.900 --> 02:48.433
- Oh, no you don't!
- 哦，不，你不！

02:48.500 --> 02:49.767
Hoo-hah!
呼哈！

02:49.833 --> 02:51.233
Karate slice! Hi-yah!
空手道切片！嗨呀！

02:51.300 --> 02:54.233
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:54.300 --> 02:56.500
- [crunching]
- [嘎吱嘎吱]

02:56.567 --> 02:58.100
- Enjoy the cake, everybody.
- 大家一起享用蛋糕吧。

02:58.167 --> 02:59.900
I made it special
just for Sandy.
我让它变得特别
只为了桑迪。

03:00.067 --> 03:02.833
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

03:02.900 --> 03:04.233
[gulps]
Mmm.
[吞咽]
嗯。

03:04.300 --> 03:05.900
- I'm allergic to nuts.
- 我对坚果过敏。

03:05.967 --> 03:07.300
Are there any nuts in that?
里面有坚果吗？

03:07.367 --> 03:09.500
- Nope, no nuts.
- Oh, okay.
- 不，没有坚果。
- 哦好的。

03:09.567 --> 03:11.967
- Oh, unless
you count "wall nuts".
-哦，除非
你算“墙坚果”。

03:12.067 --> 03:13.500
- What--
[yelling]
- 什么--
[大喊]

03:13.567 --> 03:15.900
- I'm pretty sure walnuts
are a fruit though, huh?
- 我很确定核桃
是水果吗？

03:15.967 --> 03:17.167
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:17.233 --> 03:18.633
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

03:18.700 --> 03:19.833
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

03:19.900 --> 03:21.067
- Mmm!
[rumbling]
- 嗯！
[隆隆声]

03:21.067 --> 03:23.700
Whoa-oh-oh-oh-oh!
哇哦哦哦哦！

03:23.767 --> 03:25.700
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

03:25.767 --> 03:27.300
[crunching]
[嘎吱嘎吱]

03:27.367 --> 03:29.500
Huh? Whoa!
[rumbling continues]
啊？哇！
[隆隆声继续]

03:29.567 --> 03:31.300
- Whoa!
- 哇！

03:31.367 --> 03:32.833
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

03:32.900 --> 03:34.433
Tex Ritter!
特克斯·里特！

03:34.500 --> 03:36.200
You don't see that everyday.
你不会每天都看到这样的情况。

03:36.267 --> 03:38.400
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

03:38.467 --> 03:40.600
Huh?
啊？

03:40.667 --> 03:43.400
all: Ooh! Pretty!
全体：噢！漂亮的！

03:43.467 --> 03:45.400
Last time I saw a moon
that big,
上次我看见月亮
这么大，

03:45.467 --> 03:47.567
it was in a locker room.
[chuckles]
那是在更衣室里。
[笑声]

03:47.633 --> 03:49.633
- Since when is the moon
so green?
- 月亮从什么时候开始
这么绿？

03:49.700 --> 03:51.233
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

03:51.300 --> 03:54.767
Everyone knows the moon
is made of cheese, SpongeBob.
大家都知道月亮
海绵宝宝是用奶酪制成的。

03:54.833 --> 03:57.167
[gulping]
It's just been up there so long,
[吞咽]
刚刚在上面呆了这么久

03:57.233 --> 03:58.700
it's getting moldy.
它正在发霉。

03:58.767 --> 04:01.233
Oh, but I'd still eat it.
哦，不过我还是想吃。

04:01.300 --> 04:03.067
[gobbling]
[狼吞虎咽]

04:03.100 --> 04:04.600
- That ain't the moon, guys.
- 那不是月亮，伙计们。

04:04.667 --> 04:07.467
The real moon comes out
at night, remember?
真正的月亮出来了
晚上，还记得吗？

04:07.533 --> 04:09.800
Something fishy's
going on here.
有鱼腥味的东西
正在这里进行。

04:09.867 --> 04:12.333
- Attagirl, Sissy.
- I got it!
- 阿塔女孩，娘娘腔。
- 我得到了它！

04:12.400 --> 04:13.867
- Look out, Mom!
- Hey, kids,
- 小心，妈妈！
- 嘿，孩子们，

04:13.933 --> 04:17.067
check out that cool,
glowing rock in the sky.
看看那很酷，
天空中发光的岩石。

04:17.133 --> 04:18.800
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:18.867 --> 04:21.800
[warbling]
[颤音]

04:21.867 --> 04:23.800
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:23.867 --> 04:25.467
[all munching]
[全都在咀嚼]

04:25.533 --> 04:27.600
- You don't see that every day.
- 你不会每天都看到这样的情况。

04:27.667 --> 04:29.200
Did you see that, SpongeBob?
你看到了吗，海绵宝宝？

04:29.267 --> 04:31.067
Sponge...Bob?
海绵……鲍勃？

04:31.133 --> 04:37.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:37.133 --> 04:40.067
[light beaming]
- Huh?
[光束]
- 啊？

04:40.133 --> 04:41.200
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:41.267 --> 04:42.633
[munching]
[咀嚼]

04:42.700 --> 04:43.633
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:43.700 --> 04:45.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:45.100 --> 04:47.233
[both chanting]
Green cheese, green cheese!
[两人齐声吟诵]
绿奶酪，绿奶酪！

04:47.300 --> 04:48.767
Green cheese!
绿色奶酪！

04:48.833 --> 04:51.100
[light beaming]
[光束]

04:51.167 --> 04:53.100
- SpongeBob? Patrick?
- 海绵宝宝？帕特里克？

04:53.167 --> 04:57.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:57.100 --> 04:58.167
[gasps]
[喘气]

04:58.233 --> 04:59.400
Everyone, listen to me!
大家听我说！

04:59.467 --> 05:01.067
Get away from the light!
远离光！

05:01.133 --> 05:03.333
The light is bad!
光线不好！

05:03.400 --> 05:05.867
Run for the shade!
跑到树荫下去！

05:05.933 --> 05:08.600
- So romantic.
- 太浪漫了。

05:08.667 --> 05:09.933
- Oh-ho!
- 哦嗬！

05:10.067 --> 05:11.933
- Eugene-ikins,
- 尤金-伊金斯，

05:12.067 --> 05:14.433
give me some sugar.
给我一些糖。

05:14.500 --> 05:16.967
- I'm always a sucker
for a good smooch.
- 我永远都是个傻瓜
为了一个美好的接吻。

05:17.067 --> 05:19.967
[light beaming]
[光束]

05:20.067 --> 05:26.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:26.100 --> 05:29.967
- Yeah, walk outside and
check out this awesome moon.
- 是的，走到外面
看看这个很棒的月亮。

05:30.067 --> 05:32.967
[light beaming]
[光束]

05:33.067 --> 05:34.533
Agh!
啊啊！

05:34.600 --> 05:38.067
- Hello? Hello, Pearl?
- 你好？你好，珍珠？

05:38.067 --> 05:41.067
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:41.067 --> 05:44.067
[light beaming]
[光束]

05:44.067 --> 05:51.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:51.067 --> 05:52.700
- No! Not me!
- 不！不是我！

05:52.767 --> 05:55.100
[yelling]
[大喊]

05:55.167 --> 05:56.567
Huh?
啊？

05:56.633 --> 05:58.433
I guess it only effects
sea critters,
我猜它只会影响
海洋生物，

05:58.500 --> 06:01.067
but I still don't get why
that green moon
但我还是不明白为什么
那绿色的月亮

06:01.100 --> 06:04.100
is turning everyone
into wild swimming fish?
正在改变每个人
变成野生游鱼？

06:04.167 --> 06:05.433
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:05.500 --> 06:07.967
Am I the only one left?
难道只剩下我一个人了吗？

06:08.067 --> 06:10.767
[toilet flushes]
[厕所冲水]

06:10.833 --> 06:13.300
- Oh, whoever used
that restroom last
- 哦，不管谁用过
最后那个厕所

06:13.367 --> 06:15.500
was an animal!
是一只动物！

06:15.567 --> 06:17.500
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

06:17.567 --> 06:19.367
- Hey, put me down!
- 嘿，放我下来！

06:19.433 --> 06:21.067
Sandy!
What are you doing?
沙！
你在干什么？

06:21.100 --> 06:22.900
Ow! That hurts!
噢！好痛啊！

06:22.967 --> 06:25.367
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:25.433 --> 06:27.500
[groans]
What is the meaning of--
[呻吟]
是什么意思——

06:27.567 --> 06:29.067
- Get in the shade!
- 到阴凉处去！

06:29.100 --> 06:30.967
[light beaming]
[光束]

06:31.067 --> 06:32.700
- I demand an explanation!
- 我要求一个解释！

06:32.767 --> 06:34.900
- I'm getting one
right now, Squidward!
- 我要买一个
现在，章鱼哥！

06:34.967 --> 06:37.067
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

06:37.100 --> 06:38.367
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:38.433 --> 06:40.700
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

06:40.767 --> 06:42.900
Hello?
French Narrator speaking.
你好？
法语解说员讲话。

06:42.967 --> 06:44.067
- Hey, Frenchy!
- 嘿，法国人！

06:44.100 --> 06:45.167
It's me, Sandy!
是我，桑迪！

06:45.233 --> 06:46.567
- Ah, Sandy Cheeks.
- 啊，桑迪·奇克斯。

06:46.633 --> 06:48.233
How is it hanging?
挂得怎么样了？

06:48.300 --> 06:50.433
- Oh, it's not hanging
too good, Frenchy.
-哦，这不是挂着的
太好了，法国人。

06:50.500 --> 06:52.500
You see, there's this--
- Don't say another word.
你看，有这个——
- 别再说了。

06:52.567 --> 06:54.500
I have been monitoring
the behavior
我一直在监控
行为

06:54.567 --> 06:56.500
of the green moon all day.
一整天的绿色月亮。

06:56.567 --> 06:58.833
It is called Neptune's Moon.
它被称为海王星的月亮。

06:58.900 --> 07:00.433
Every 100 years,
每100年，

07:00.500 --> 07:02.767
it de-evolves everyone
in Bikini Bottom
它使每个人都退化
比基尼下装

07:02.833 --> 07:04.967
into primal fish for two hours.
放入原始鱼中两个小时。

07:05.067 --> 07:06.467
- Two hours?
- 两个小时？

07:06.533 --> 07:08.667
- Until it falls
into another volcano
- 直到它倒下
进入另一座火山

07:08.733 --> 07:11.467
and is extinguished.
并熄灭。

07:11.533 --> 07:13.467
- I knewed it was nature,
dagnabit!
- 我知道这是自然，
哎呀！

07:13.533 --> 07:15.067
That's a relief.
这真是一种解脱。

07:15.133 --> 07:17.133
So I just have to keep Squidward
in the shade
所以我只需要保留章鱼哥
在树荫下

07:17.200 --> 07:18.200
for a couple of hours.
几个小时。

07:18.267 --> 07:20.200
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:20.267 --> 07:22.200
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

07:22.267 --> 07:23.900
[whale singing]
- Phew!
[鲸鱼的歌声]
- 唷！

07:23.967 --> 07:24.967
Thanks, Frenchy.
谢谢，法国人。

07:25.067 --> 07:27.100
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

07:27.167 --> 07:29.300
I'm going home to hide
under the covers!
我要回家躲起来
在幕后！

07:29.367 --> 07:31.467
It's every cephalopod
for himself!
这是每一个头足类动物
为了他自己！

07:31.533 --> 07:32.700
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:32.767 --> 07:34.600
Frenchy, I gotta call you back!
法国人，我得给你回电话！

07:34.667 --> 07:37.800
Squidward,
you have to stay in the shade!
章鱼哥，
你必须呆在阴凉处！

07:37.867 --> 07:39.400
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:39.467 --> 07:42.133
[yelling]
Help!
[大喊]
救命啊！

07:42.200 --> 07:44.267
- Squidward! No!
- 章鱼哥！不！

07:44.333 --> 07:46.133
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:46.200 --> 07:49.133
[light beaming]
[光束]

07:49.200 --> 07:50.533
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:50.600 --> 07:52.667
- O.M. Jehoshaphat!
- O.M.约沙法！

07:52.733 --> 07:54.200
You don't see that everyday.
你不会每天都看到这样的情况。

07:54.267 --> 07:56.067
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:56.067 --> 07:58.933
My friends are gonna be lunch
if I don't think fast!
我的朋友们要吃午饭了
if I don't think fast!

07:59.067 --> 08:00.267
[buzzing]
[嗡嗡声]

08:00.333 --> 08:02.133
[growling]
[咆哮]

08:02.200 --> 08:04.533
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:04.600 --> 08:06.467
SpongeBob! Patrick!
海绵宝宝！帕特里克！

08:06.533 --> 08:08.467
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:08.533 --> 08:09.600
Mrs. Puff!
泡芙太太！

08:09.667 --> 08:10.800
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

08:10.867 --> 08:11.867
Larry!
拉里！

08:11.933 --> 08:13.267
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:13.333 --> 08:15.067
Yeeouch!
哎呀！

08:15.067 --> 08:16.400
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:16.467 --> 08:17.933
Look out, Pearl!
小心，珍珠！

08:18.067 --> 08:19.933
I'll save you!
我来救你！

08:20.067 --> 08:21.167
Yee-ha!
呀哈！

08:21.233 --> 08:23.067
[growling]
[咆哮]

08:23.100 --> 08:24.567
[laughing]
[笑]

08:24.633 --> 08:26.433
Like busting a bronco!
就像打败一匹野马一样！

08:26.500 --> 08:28.100
Yee-ha!
呀哈！

08:28.167 --> 08:30.100
[Pearl singing]
【珍珠歌声】

08:30.167 --> 08:33.367
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:33.433 --> 08:35.367
Whoa-oh-oh-oh!
哇哦哦哦！

08:35.433 --> 08:36.400
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:36.467 --> 08:39.200
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:39.267 --> 08:42.200
Not the blowhole!
不是气孔！

08:42.267 --> 08:45.067
[water sloshing]
[水晃动]

08:45.133 --> 08:47.200
[yelling]
[大喊]

08:47.267 --> 08:49.133
[groaning]
[呻吟]

08:49.200 --> 08:56.233
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:59.100 --> 09:01.167
[explosive boom]
[爆炸声]

09:01.233 --> 09:03.167
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:03.233 --> 09:04.567
[Pearl singing]
【珍珠歌声】

09:04.633 --> 09:06.433
Hey! Everybody!
嘿！大家！

09:06.500 --> 09:08.367
The light is bad!
光线不好！

09:08.433 --> 09:10.167
Stay away from the light!
远离光！

09:10.233 --> 09:12.367
- License and registration,
please?
- 许可证和注册，
请问？

09:12.433 --> 09:13.600
[police radio chatter]
[警察电台喋喋不休]

09:13.667 --> 09:16.467
[light beaming]
[光束]

09:16.533 --> 09:17.633
[both crunching]
[两者都嘎吱作响]

09:17.700 --> 09:23.700
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:23.767 --> 09:25.400
Hold your breath, critters.
屏住呼吸，小动物们。

09:25.467 --> 09:26.400
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:26.467 --> 09:27.733
- Uh-oh!
- 呃哦！

09:27.800 --> 09:30.267
[panicked screaming]
[惊慌尖叫]

09:30.333 --> 09:32.133
Whale!
鲸！

09:32.200 --> 09:34.400
Stroke! Stroke!
中风！中风！

09:34.467 --> 09:35.733
Stroke!
中风！

09:35.800 --> 09:38.733
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

09:38.800 --> 09:42.600
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:42.667 --> 09:44.133
Oh! Oh, Potty!
哦！哦，波蒂！

09:44.200 --> 09:46.133
We're taking on water!
我们正在取水！

09:46.200 --> 09:47.933
[straining]
[紧张]

09:48.067 --> 09:50.133
A little help here,
please, Potty?
这里有一点帮助，
拜托，波蒂？

09:50.200 --> 09:51.400
[water sloshing]
[水晃动]

09:51.467 --> 09:52.933
Oh!
哦！

09:53.067 --> 09:55.800
Get out of here,
you fiendish feather duster!
离开这里，
你这个邪恶的鸡毛掸子！

09:55.867 --> 09:58.400
Shoo! Shoo! I said, shoo!
嘘！嘘！我说，嘘！

09:58.467 --> 09:59.667
I'll do it meself.
我自己来做吧。

09:59.733 --> 10:01.233
I don't need your help.
我不需要你的帮助。

10:01.300 --> 10:04.967
I'm perfectly fine
doing it by meself.
我很好
我自己做。

10:05.033 --> 10:07.700
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:07.767 --> 10:09.700
Here's where we get off.
这是我们下车的地方。

10:09.767 --> 10:12.567
[Pearl singing]
【珍珠歌声】

10:12.633 --> 10:14.633
[grunts]
Thanks for the lift, Pearl!
[咕哝]
谢谢你搭车，珍珠！

10:14.700 --> 10:16.167
Don't you worry.
别担心。

10:16.233 --> 10:18.367
Nobody's going to eat you guys
on my watch.
没人会吃掉你们
在我的监视下。

10:18.433 --> 10:19.967
Ow!
噢！

10:20.033 --> 10:21.600
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:21.667 --> 10:23.633
Dinner time!
Come and get it!
晚餐时间！
快过来取！

10:23.700 --> 10:26.367
- [munching]
- [slurping]
- [咀嚼]
- [发出声音]

10:26.433 --> 10:28.700
- [straining]
- [紧张]

10:28.767 --> 10:31.033
- This is so fascinating,
Frenchy.
- 这太令人着迷了
法国味。

10:31.100 --> 10:32.667
Tell me more about
my fishy friends.
告诉我更多关于
我的鱼友们。

10:32.733 --> 10:35.800
Oh, wait.
I'll put you on speaker phone.
哦，等等。
我会给你转免提电话。

10:35.867 --> 10:37.833
- Ah, the lobster.
- 啊，龙虾。

10:37.900 --> 10:39.500
The cockroach of the sea.
海里的蟑螂。

10:39.567 --> 10:41.333
Skittering across
the ocean floor,
掠过
海底，

10:41.400 --> 10:44.400
the lobster sheds its skin
once a week...
龙虾蜕皮
每周一次...

10:44.467 --> 10:47.733
- [straining]
- [紧张]

10:47.800 --> 10:51.667
- And then eats it.
- [munching]
- 然后吃掉它。
- [咀嚼]

10:51.733 --> 10:54.067
- Now that's what I call
recycling, huh, Frenchy?
- 现在这就是我所说的
回收，嗯，法国人？

10:54.133 --> 10:58.200
- Ah, notice the scavenger crab
eating garbage
- 啊，注意清道蟹
吃垃圾

10:58.267 --> 11:02.067
unaware he is being stalked
by his natural predator,
不知道他正在被跟踪
被他的天敌，

11:02.133 --> 11:04.867
the puffer fish.
河豚鱼。

11:04.933 --> 11:07.200
- Oh, no, you don't.
- [grunting]
- 哦，不，你不知道。
- [咕哝]

11:07.267 --> 11:08.933
- Ow!
- 噢！

11:09.067 --> 11:12.133
- I knew I was gonna have
to separate you two.
- 我知道我会的
来分开你们两个。

11:12.200 --> 11:15.667
[strains]
You're welcome, Mr. Krabs
[菌株]
不客气，蟹老板

11:15.733 --> 11:16.933
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

11:17.067 --> 11:19.167
Ouch!
哎哟!

11:19.233 --> 11:22.300
Yeowch!
哟哟哟！

11:22.367 --> 11:23.900
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

11:23.967 --> 11:27.067
- Ah, observe how
the hungry sea star
- 啊，观察一下如何
饥饿的海星

11:27.067 --> 11:30.200
ejects his own stomach
from his body
弹出自己的胃
从他的身体

11:30.267 --> 11:32.133
in order to eat his meal
为了吃他的饭

11:32.200 --> 11:35.667
where the primitive sea sponge
filters nutrients
原始海绵的所在地
过滤营养成分

11:35.733 --> 11:38.500
and oxygen from bacteria
particles.
和来自细菌的氧气
颗粒。

11:38.567 --> 11:40.200
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

11:40.267 --> 11:41.400
- [laughs]
- [笑]

11:41.467 --> 11:42.867
[camera shutter clicks]
[相机快门声]

11:42.933 --> 11:46.367
SpongeBob is never
gonna believe this.
海绵宝宝从来都不是
会相信这一点。

11:46.433 --> 11:47.733
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

11:47.800 --> 11:50.300
- Ah, the giant octopus.
- 啊，巨型章鱼。

11:50.367 --> 11:53.133
One of the largest predators
on the ocean floor.
最大的掠食者之一
在海底。

11:53.200 --> 11:56.100
- Texas toast!
It's a good thing my tree dome
- 德克萨斯吐司！
我的树顶是件好事

11:56.167 --> 11:58.067
is made of ten tons
of pressure proof glass,
由十吨制成
耐压玻璃，

11:58.100 --> 12:00.467
huh, Frenchy?
- Oui, Sandy, that is true,
嗯，法国人？
- 噢，桑迪，这是真的，

12:00.533 --> 12:02.567
but, unfortunately,
the poisonous
但是，不幸的是，
有毒的

12:02.633 --> 12:05.900
and highly intelligent octopus
can also cut through
和高度聪明的章鱼
也可以切入

12:05.967 --> 12:08.100
hard bedrock with its beak.
坚硬的基岩和它的喙。

12:08.167 --> 12:09.600
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

12:09.667 --> 12:12.067
[whirring]
[呼呼]

12:12.100 --> 12:14.667
- You don't
see that everyday!
- 你不
每天都看到这一点！

12:14.733 --> 12:17.533
Squidward, no!
章鱼哥，不！

12:17.600 --> 12:19.633
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

12:19.700 --> 12:22.633
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

12:22.700 --> 12:26.667
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

12:26.733 --> 12:28.300
- [roars, growling]
- [咆哮，咆哮]

12:28.367 --> 12:31.400
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

12:33.067 --> 12:35.600
Whoa!
哇！

12:35.667 --> 12:38.500
[grunts]
Ooh!
[咕哝]
哦！

12:38.567 --> 12:41.800
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

12:43.633 --> 12:44.933
- Hi-yah!
- 嗨呀！

12:45.067 --> 12:48.333
Aah, hominy grits!
啊啊，玉米粥！

12:48.400 --> 12:50.333
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

12:50.400 --> 12:53.433
- Ah, the battle
for the survival of the fittest
- 啊，战斗
为了适者生存

12:53.500 --> 12:55.667
rages on in the animal kingdom.
在动物王国里肆虐。

12:55.733 --> 12:58.833
- My friends!
My tree!
- 我的朋友们！
我的树！

12:58.900 --> 13:01.100
- Sandy, you must remember,
- 桑迪，你必须记住，

13:01.167 --> 13:04.600
who is the natural enemy
of the octopus?
谁是天敌
章鱼的？

13:04.667 --> 13:07.800
- That's a great idea.
[strains]
- 这是个好主意。
[菌株]

13:08.600 --> 13:10.400
- Using her versatile tail,
- 利用她多才多艺的尾巴，

13:10.467 --> 13:12.767
the Texas land squirrel
calls out
德克萨斯州的陆松鼠
大声喊叫

13:12.833 --> 13:15.600
to the natural enemy
of the octopus.
对天敌
章鱼的。

13:15.667 --> 13:17.667
- There she blows, y'all!
- 她在那里吹，你们大家！

13:17.733 --> 13:20.267
- [bellows]
- The whale.
- [怒吼]
- 鲸鱼。

13:20.333 --> 13:23.600
- Sick 'em, Pearl!
Sorry, Squidward!
- 烦死他们了，珀尔！
对不起，章鱼哥！

13:23.667 --> 13:26.900
[both growling, grunting]
[双方咆哮，咕哝]

13:33.667 --> 13:35.367
Ooh! Ohh!
哦！哦！

13:35.433 --> 13:38.367
[growling and grunting
continues]
[咆哮和咕噜声
继续]

13:38.433 --> 13:41.200
[alarm rings]
Oh! Two hours is up?
[警报响起]
哦！两个小时到了？

13:41.267 --> 13:42.733
Thank goodness.
谢天谢地。

13:42.800 --> 13:46.167
- And so we bid a fond adieu
to Neptune's moon
- 所以我们深情地告别
到海王星的卫星

13:46.233 --> 13:50.300
as it descends back into
the Earth from whence it came.
当它下降回到
地球从何而来。

13:50.367 --> 13:52.900
We will see it again
in 100 years.
我们会再次看到它
100年后。

13:52.967 --> 13:56.333
[foghorn blows]
Goal!
[雾号吹响]
进球！

13:56.400 --> 14:01.267
[both grunting, gasp]
[两人都咕哝着，喘着粗气]

14:01.333 --> 14:03.567
[both giggle]
[两人都咯咯笑]

14:04.767 --> 14:07.733
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

14:07.800 --> 14:13.067
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

14:13.067 --> 14:14.600
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

14:14.667 --> 14:16.867
What is going on here?
这是怎么回事？

14:16.933 --> 14:18.233
[gasps]
My clothes!
[喘气]
我的衣服！

14:18.300 --> 14:19.367
[screams]
[尖叫声]

14:19.433 --> 14:22.467
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

14:24.433 --> 14:25.800
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

14:25.867 --> 14:29.300
- [strains]
- [laughs]
- [菌株]
- [笑]

14:29.367 --> 14:31.100
[grunts]
[咕哝]

14:32.400 --> 14:34.867
- Um, Sandy, how come
your tree dome is broken
- 嗯，桑迪，怎么会这样
你的树顶坏了

14:34.933 --> 14:36.700
and everyone's naked?
- Well, SpongeBob,
每个人都赤身裸体？
- 嗯，海绵宝宝，

14:36.767 --> 14:39.333
let's just say this has been
the most interesting birthday
我们就说这已经是
最有趣的生日

14:39.400 --> 14:42.067
I ever had.
- And, of course,
我曾经有过。
- 当然，

14:42.100 --> 14:44.900
Neptune's moon
is always followed by
海王星的月亮
总是跟随

14:44.967 --> 14:48.200
Neptune's sun.
[all exclaiming]
海王星的太阳。
[所有人惊呼]

14:51.667 --> 14:55.433
[warbling]
[all moaning]
[颤音]
[全都呻吟]

14:55.500 --> 14:59.267
- [chittering]
- [叽叽喳喳]

14:59.333 --> 15:02.667
both:
You don't see that everyday.
两者：
你不会每天都看到这样的情况。

15:02.733 --> 15:04.833
Jinx!
Buy me a patty!
金克斯！
给我买一块肉饼吧！

15:04.900 --> 15:06.667
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

15:06.733 --> 15:08.933
- [chittering]
- [叽叽喳喳]

15:09.067 --> 15:11.400
- Ah, Bikini Bottom.
- 啊，比基尼泳裤。

15:11.467 --> 15:14.867
Teaming with life
and naked mysteries.
与生活同行
和赤裸裸的神秘。

15:14.933 --> 15:16.667
This next whale song
is going out
下一首鲸鱼之歌
正在外出

15:16.733 --> 15:20.600
to my favorite squirrel.
Sandy, happy birthday.
致我最喜欢的松鼠。
桑迪，生日快乐。

15:20.667 --> 15:23.833
- Yee haw!
- 哎呀！

15:23.900 --> 15:26.100
Whoo!
- Ooh, Potty,
呼！
- 哦，便盆，

15:26.167 --> 15:28.200
I never thought it'd end up
like this,
我从没想过它会结束
像这样，

15:28.267 --> 15:31.333
brunch for a shark.
- I guess this is it.
鲨鱼早午餐。
- 我想就是这样了。

15:31.400 --> 15:33.067
Good-bye, Patchy.
再见，帕奇。

15:33.067 --> 15:36.467
- Good-bye, Potty.
[crying]
- 再见，波蒂。
[哭泣]

15:36.533 --> 15:41.800
[screaming]
[尖叫]

15:41.867 --> 15:44.133
Huh?
- Hello!
啊？
- 你好！

15:44.200 --> 15:46.567
- Frenchy, you surprising
scallywag!
- 法国人，你令人惊讶
恶棍！

15:46.633 --> 15:48.233
Get--What are you doing here?
得到——你在这里做什么？

15:48.300 --> 15:52.333
- Ah, Patchy the pirate,
I just swam back to warn you
- 啊，海盗帕奇，
我只是游回来警告你

15:52.400 --> 15:55.400
about Neptune's sun,
but it's too late.
关于海王星的太阳，
但已经太晚了。

15:55.467 --> 15:57.467
Au revoir.
再见。

15:57.533 --> 16:00.067
- Bye.
- 再见。

16:00.067 --> 16:02.533
Neptune's sun?
海王星的太阳？

16:02.600 --> 16:05.133
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

16:05.200 --> 16:08.433
[screams]
What's happening?!
[尖叫声]
发生什么事了？

16:12.067 --> 16:15.300
- [squawking]
- [grunting]
- [嘎嘎叫]
- [咕哝]

16:25.833 --> 16:28.533
[bell dings]
- Mm, yummy.
[铃声]
- 嗯，好吃。

16:28.600 --> 16:31.633
[laughs]
- [grunting]
[笑]
- [咕哝]

[笑]
- [咕哝]